      "category": "interaction",
      "text": "A grave robber carries the following infused items: 2 Bottled Lightning (Lesser), a Frost Vial (Lesser), and a Thunderstone (Lesser).\n\nThese items last for 24 hours, or until the next time the grave robber makes their daily preparations."
